cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
title: "EudraGMDP GMP Non-Compliance Statements (wss-gmp-noncompliance)"
abstract: >-
  Point-in-time captures of the EudraGMDP register of GMP non-compliance
  statements: pharmaceutical manufacturing sites found non-compliant by EU
  national inspectorates, with site, address, country, inspection end date and
  issue date. The register carries eleven columns and no status field, so a
  statement that is later resolved has nowhere to be marked resolved and must
  either be edited in place or removed. Whichever happens, the register as it
  stood on a given date is not recoverable from the publisher afterwards.
authors:
  - name: "q3dresearch"
    website: "https://github.com/q3dresearch"
# No `license:` field: EMA's reproduction terms could not be established
# (checked 2026-09-22). An absent field means unspecified -- wss-engine
